# An X session on Dolly's display: the Xsdl server, twm managing the
# windows, and three of X's own clients in theirs: a clock, eyes that follow
# the pointer and a terminal with a shell, where imgui-x11 starts Dear ImGui's
# example in a window of its own.
FROM /v0.1.4/Dollyfile-system d55a0b99974e61917c0aa46b271a3c97027c212087d6ac6b4bb56ad718487976
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xorg-server d5deaa221134bc9814cb2038c2069ffea1c3544bdc5a3e4447cf32b82a80ac1e
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-twm 558b2bde27018518e8f2327e8950a14e10dc90f2756f295d56c4d9ffce910423
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xclock 492c42413653625752526545a23fdf57d856936903bbb5e154bfe4daa14346f5
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xeyes 26fe4a26aeb5d23cd737c789a0037d1531fedc61f68215fa4dd893f6bc68da98
